Rich Payne wrote:
> 
> On Thu, 18 Nov 1999 mikeh@iuinc.com wrote:
> 
> > udb. i  can't seem to select individual packages to install... 
> 
> Now, you don't mention which version this is but I'm assuming 6.0? There's
> a problem with the installer image in 6.0 that causes it to sig 11 when
> selecting individual packages.

The problems are, actually, in librpm; in many places pointers are
dereferenced without checking first that they were initialized first
to something non-NULL.

A long time ago I filed a bug report together with patches and did not
hear anything back since.  Frankly I am not sure if these pointers
**should** be initialized at these points, and we see results of some
other bug, but patching libraries does help. :-)

  Michal


