  collect2: ld returned 1 exit status
  52.3% CPU (Elapsed=20:18.82, sys=6.675, user=631.040)

  icarus.com % gcc -v
  Reading specs from /usr/lib/gcc-lib/alpha-redhat-linux/egcs-2.91.66/specs
